1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,262
Satu sumber air,

2
00:00:01,282 --> 00:00:02,421
dua giliran:

3
00:00:02,441 --> 00:00:04,278
sehari untuk seekor unta,

4
00:00:04,298 --> 00:00:06,362
sehari untuk seluruh kaum.

5
00:00:06,382 --> 00:00:07,956
Aturan sederhana ini menjadi

6
00:00:07,976 --> 00:00:09,401
ujian bagi kaum Tsamud.

7
00:00:09,421 --> 00:00:11,190
Kaum Tsamud hidup makmur.

8
00:00:11,210 --> 00:00:12,505
Mereka memahat gunung menjadi

9
00:00:12,525 --> 00:00:13,806
rumah, punya kebun,

10
00:00:13,826 --> 00:00:14,673
mata air,

11
00:00:14,693 --> 00:00:15,787
dan kurma yang mayangnya

12
00:00:15,807 --> 00:00:16,267
lembut.

13
00:00:16,287 --> 00:00:17,335
Surah Asy-Syu'ara mencatat

14
00:00:17,355 --> 00:00:18,112
semua itu.

15
00:00:18,132 --> 00:00:19,366
Nabi Saleh mengajak mereka

16
00:00:19,386 --> 00:00:20,434
menyembah Allah.

17
00:00:20,454 --> 00:00:21,425
Jawab mereka:

18
00:00:21,445 --> 00:00:22,864
kamu cuma manusia seperti

19
00:00:22,884 --> 00:00:23,534
kami.

20
00:00:23,554 --> 00:00:25,338
Datangkan mukjizat kalau kamu

21
00:00:25,358 --> 00:00:26,473
memang benar.

22
00:00:26,493 --> 00:00:28,470
Datanglah seekor unta betina

23
00:00:28,490 --> 00:00:29,322
dari Allah.

24
00:00:29,342 --> 00:00:30,669
Pesannya jelas:

25
00:00:30,689 --> 00:00:33,130
unta ini punya giliran minum,

26
00:00:33,150 --> 00:00:35,299
kalian juga punya giliran.

27
00:00:35,319 --> 00:00:36,894
Jangan sentuh dia dengan niat

28
00:00:36,914 --> 00:00:37,704
jahat.

29
00:00:37,724 --> 00:00:39,020
Tapi para pemuka yang sombong

30
00:00:39,040 --> 00:00:39,879
menolak.

31
00:00:39,899 --> 00:00:41,380
Mereka memanggil kawannya,

32
00:00:41,400 --> 00:00:42,758
orang paling celaka di antara

33
00:00:42,778 --> 00:00:44,445
mereka, lalu unta itu

34
00:00:44,465 --> 00:00:45,175
disembelih.

35
00:00:45,195 --> 00:00:45,965
Wahai Saleh,

36
00:00:45,985 --> 00:00:47,303
buktikan ancamanmu,

37
00:00:47,323 --> 00:00:48,196
kata mereka.

38
00:00:48,216 --> 00:00:49,556
Lalu datanglah gempa.

39
00:00:49,576 --> 00:00:51,414
Rumah-rumah yang mereka pahat

40
00:00:51,434 --> 00:00:52,947
dengan bangga menjadi

41
00:00:52,967 --> 00:00:53,791
reruntuhan.

42
00:00:53,811 --> 00:00:55,370
Surah Asy-Syams menyebut,

43
00:00:55,390 --> 00:00:57,444
Tuhan meratakan mereka dengan

44
00:00:57,464 --> 00:00:57,929
tanah.

45
00:00:57,949 --> 00:00:59,462
Di barat laut Arab Saudi ada

46
00:00:59,482 --> 00:01:01,970
Al-Hijr, atau Mada'in Saleh.

47
00:01:01,990 --> 00:01:03,596
Al-Qur'an mengaitkan Al-Hijr

48
00:01:03,616 --> 00:01:04,824
dengan kaum Tsamud.

49
00:01:04,844 --> 00:01:06,233
Tapi makam batu yang terkenal

50
00:01:06,253 --> 00:01:07,747
di sana dipahat bangsa Nabath,

51
00:01:07,767 --> 00:01:08,734
jauh setelahnya.

52
00:01:08,754 --> 00:01:10,019
Situs ini menjadi Warisan

53
00:01:10,039 --> 00:01:12,052
Dunia UNESCO sejak 2008.

54
00:01:12,072 --> 00:01:13,514
Ujiannya bukan unta,

55
00:01:13,534 --> 00:01:15,396
tapi kesediaan berbagi air.

56
00:01:15,416 --> 00:01:16,263
Menurut kamu,

57
00:01:16,283 --> 00:01:18,399
ujian berbagi apa yang paling

58
00:01:18,419 --> 00:01:19,536
sulit hari ini?

59
00:01:19,556 --> 00:01:21,038
Kisah dalam Al-Qur'an,

60
00:01:21,058 --> 00:01:22,355
bersama AUDIRA.

